{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "66dd9568f065123796e6606b2f32eb8850272832b3c77fc9de9259c162e5b512", "ja": "（今日は、海美の宣材写真撮影だ。撮影自体は\n初めてじゃないと思うけど、どうだろう……）", "zh": "（今天要拍海美的宣传照。\n拍摄本身她应该不是第一次体验，不知道是否如此……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "20574ed1623f9fca0ae965ae245c07e1b965c4674b550d0bbe41dde7caa6f9b4", "ja": "わ～～、すご～～い！？\nめちゃくちゃ立派なスタジオだよーっ！？", "zh": "哇～～好厉害～～！？\n好棒的摄影棚喔──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "1cde78cc01b93c4a8d0fca74ad63ba2ae542ab58cc2af1c80f4d15ab03af8807", "ja": "こんなトコで写真を撮ってもらえるなんて、\nなんか本物のアイドルになったみたいだねっ☆", "zh": "居然能在这种地方拍照，\n感觉好像变成真正的偶像了呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "00162d96ffaa9cebca57c8de7e6435ffa043321342d7746033fc8785ebfe5862", "ja": "はは、みたいじゃなくて、\nこれから本当にアイドルになるんだけどな？", "zh": "哈哈，不是好像，\n你的确即将成为真正的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "85c6a19752a25d46c72a8eb1febd7f12b0fefe900101d08c37d2a4553f103766", "ja": "あ、そっか！　アイドルの撮影ってコトは……\nこれから撮る写真が、雑誌とかに載っちゃう！？", "zh": "啊，对耶！偶像的拍摄……\n意思是等一下拍的照片会登在杂志之类的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ff049a34d43319369794ceb700f4b4f8a23304689c9d7a5f506d500f2f2f6227", "ja": "宣材写真だから、雑誌に載る写真とは少し違うかな。\nこれは海美のことを知ってもらうための写真なんだ。", "zh": "因为这是宣传照，跟登在杂志上的照片有点不一样。\n这是用来让人认识海美的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "d16a1d7b313b45b6f9216b01f572424b987acc8b435d667c5413ce88f2215b54", "ja": "ふーん……？", "zh": "是喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6cae35074aebb59d5f8b30b95966ee55dbccaa03d8903a3101b322c898156cd6", "ja": "海美も、オーディションに写真をつけただろ。\nそれと同じで、この写真で仕事を取るんだよ。", "zh": "海美你也有在甄选时附上照片对吧？\n就跟那个一样，我们要用这张照片来争取工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0b1bd1c966d2df61ce850b05b3ca73abc8bfbe082d1424d2803351bd3a7b536a", "ja": "だから今回の撮影で、海美の魅力を、\n最大限にアピールしなくちゃな！", "zh": "所以得在这次拍摄中，\n尽可能地展现海美的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "d6aca9e050b60e8535107f1a09036223d10380b7d8f69ce498e0b72788053f9c", "ja": "そっかー。つまり、\n女子力高い！って感じにすればいいんだね？", "zh": "这样啊。也就是说，\n表现出「很有女子力！」这种感觉就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "de7505080b24c83c2e302afdcb927fcae1028b38e5c72b67a3c5486c992c76ad", "ja": "いや、女子力はあんまり……\nないより、あった方がいいかもしれないけど。", "zh": "不，跟女子力不太一样……\n虽说比起没有，还是有比较好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "d79e96c68368b3cde6f1733aaed45999a1fcbd462be4e7ceaf6796b358b0852d", "ja": "やっぱり！？　わかったよ、{$P$}！\n私、女子力～！って感じの写真にしてみせるっ！", "zh": "果然吗！？我知道了，{$P$}！\n我会拍出很有「女子力～！」的照片的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "168df57452d3ec5c784f17f40d67a2f455bcde59414d4a048c24984edfbc5642", "ja": "どんな写真なんだ……？\nとにかく、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "那是什么样的照片啊……？\n总而言之，交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "a38e87cde80c1bcf3e0d53d2fec63b4661987b61201b0dad4003ffd74c694e23", "ja": "いっきまーすっ、女子力全開ポーズ！\n私、バレエしてたから、体が超柔らかいんだーっ☆", "zh": "要上啰～女子力全开姿势！\n因为我跳过芭蕾舞，身体超柔软的喔──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1014_camman", "source_sha256": "22461db29029a6a6fc4c73c6543b766af554cb286b081f5487c65ec9a5728645", "ja": "わ、わっ！？\n海美ちゃん、それは……！", "zh": "哇、哇！？\n海美妹妹，这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "086a74f4344c17b24d632205322207e1234038c4e95ea2009c12a89153ad15b4", "ja": "うわっ、なぜ頭から足が生えて見えるんだ！？\n海美、ストップ！　ストーップ！！", "zh": "唔哇，为什么看起来像是头上长出脚了！？\n海美，停下来！停下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "c518a1849fe9c99359be41007dcf1a12d77c06cc7ccd2be2df2e7c388967c01b", "ja": "えーっ、今のポーズダメなの？\n他の人は、あんまりできないと思うんだけどな～。", "zh": "咦──刚才的姿势不行吗？\n这姿势应该很少人摆得出来啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "805fdb5404dff7855ccde893c156c2eaad21ca2fc80b152c73473cae39e8d028", "ja": "確かに、人類には難しそうなポーズだったけど……。\nアイドルだし、もう少し穏やかなポーズでいこう！", "zh": "刚才那姿势对人类来说的确很困难啦……\n但你是偶像，摆些更稳重的姿势吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "ca17f9b4c22efc085997ba1350f874da28030163a4ef49a6d8d039196bdebf1c", "ja": "そっかー。\nじゃあ普通な感じの、バレエのポーズとかにする？", "zh": "是喔──\n那要改成感觉比较普通的芭蕾舞姿势吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a288515d5452203e69d74e4e541dd1efddd44ed649e9e389ac03d4d34858c6df", "ja": "うん、その方がいいな。\nそれじゃ海美、頼んだぞ。", "zh": "嗯，那样比较好。\n那么海美，麻烦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "aec1e866838a48907eef5924ea229f37f8e453f2692331e9ec13814394ebb6a5", "ja": "はーいっ！　えっと、どのポーズがいいかな……。\nやっぱ、基本からかな？", "zh": "好～！我想想，哪个姿势比较好呢……\n还是先从基本动作开始吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "ae1d0c0acaac59de87d59bf25c0c80980de5edcc4665405d8ea0a8a8e43bc38c", "ja": "それじゃ、まずはパッセだよ！\n左足の膝を曲げて、右足の膝に爪先を着ける……。", "zh": "那么，首先是踮脚！\n左脚弯起来，把脚尖放到右膝盖上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "20848c93996da6d1f10af382f7913b7bca3f31561e1f220080d83c3065700fe5", "ja": "アラベスクは、片足を後ろに上げて片足で立つよ！\nそこから体を傾けて……アラベスク・パンシェ！", "zh": "阿拉伯姿则是要把单脚往后抬，用单脚站立！\n然后再倾斜身体……就是下倾式阿拉伯姿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1023_camman", "source_sha256": "da0ca28bd8587f10723248d34057cba6a522c74e2f5124190176042c1257635a", "ja": "あっ、そのポーズ、バレエらしくて素敵ですね！\n苦しくないですか？", "zh": "啊，这个姿势很有芭蕾的感觉，很不错呢！\n做起来不会很辛苦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "99d78fd518626a306575349b9b31c8748bef5e64ea27e907a5c23422142ec749", "ja": "ぜーんぜんっ☆\nそれじゃ次は、アティチュードいっくよ～！", "zh": "完～全不会☆\n那接下来我要做雕像姿啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8918d2a50a9706f5d0116f955710b086f025390ef888848d75819a85be869e41", "ja": "（さすが、元バレリーナだな。難しいポーズを\n次々決めているのに、いい笑顔だ！　これなら……）", "zh": "（不愧是前芭蕾舞者。明明接连摆出有难度的姿势，\n却笑得很开心！这样就没问题了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8a921852a13bfd421470b23ddac9c7674bf149ce0b012f88e50e57e133662127", "ja": "海美、お疲れさま！\n写真できたぞ、見てみるか？", "zh": "海美，辛苦你了！\n照片拍出来啰，你要看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "05cc8ab9154fddf226c2807d3b8b93163aa76ece47e4b9898bf8aea416c78c37", "ja": "うんっ、見る見る！\nどんな風に撮ってもらえたのかな～？", "zh": "嗯，我要看我要看！\n拍出来的成果如何呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "e1b0fbadbe4af70988e4a6caad2a34fe8a9bbd881c99c8c5a2378225a20d74a1", "ja": "……うわっ、スゴいね！？\nこれが私っ？", "zh": "……哇，好厉害喔！？\n这是我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1030_p", "source_sha256": "5a2df6955a54e99a9287ae02fcef393654b8900c73ab019d082b4b1f912f4360", "ja": "ああ。よく撮れてるだろ？", "zh": "对啊。是不是拍得很棒？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "536a7fc589a90cc2def63fd274334a0dda438f8ea8917d2b2f8b0be57a21e4cf", "ja": "今までとおんなじ、バレエのポーズなのに……\n顔が思いっきり笑ってるから？", "zh": "明明是跟平常一样的芭蕾舞姿势……\n是因为我笑得很开吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "bfcfe6a6cf851b43e375f3b50407cd45b7ad7a42811d12bee42329db734e8ffa", "ja": "なんか新鮮！　あははっ、面白ーいっ☆", "zh": "感觉好新鲜喔！哈哈，好好玩☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "6a7b3191da95e06a11d9b5a324f4d0d91a534d3627aeb2d6cb1194c53034344a", "ja": "アイドルになると、こんな可愛く撮ってもらえるんだね\n……やっぱり、アイドルってすごい！　カワイイ～☆", "zh": "原来当了偶像，就能被拍得这么可爱……\n偶像果然很厉害！好可爱～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1034_p", "source_sha256": "19ad7423c384c737bd70a157b848cc4d9980b5932a459fb96240e304405b2c4e", "ja": "（それはアイドルじゃなくて、海美自身の力なんだけど\n……まぁ、細かいことはいいか）", "zh": "（那不是因为当了偶像，而是海美本身的实力……\n算了，别在意这种细节。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_002_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e879c6fc1210ce8be3e7a144b5cdb550652f0414975109d7ed2fd69db424a42a", "ja": "（海美の能力は、まだまだ未知数みたいだ。\nこれから引き出していくのが、楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（海美真正的能力似乎还是未知数。\n真期待今后能逐渐引导她发挥力量！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
